### Login customer
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "customer@example.com",
  "password": "customer123"
}

### Login admin
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@example.com",
  "password": "admin123"
}

### Dynamic price
POST http://localhost:8080/api/pricing/dynamic
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productId": 1,
  "variantId": 1,
  "categoryId": 1,
  "basePrice": 399.99
}

### Promotion price calculation
POST http://localhost:8080/api/promotions/price
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "lines": [
    {
      "productId": 1,
      "productVariantId": 1,
      "categoryId": 1,
      "quantity": 2,
      "unitPrice": 399.99
    }
  ],
  "shippingAmount": 15.00
}

### Create seller
POST http://localhost:8080/api/marketplace/sellers
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "displayName": "Demo Seller",
  "slug": "demo-seller"
}

### Get recommendations
GET http://localhost:8080/api/recommendations/products/1

### Get loyalty account
GET http://localhost:8080/api/loyalty/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create return
POST http://localhost:8080/api/returns
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderId": 1,
  "reason": "Product did not meet expectations",
  "items": [
    {
      "orderItemId": 1,
      "quantity": 1,
      "refundAmount": 100.00
    }
  ]
}

### Issue invoice
POST http://localhost:8080/api/invoices/orders/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Invoice document
GET http://localhost:8080/api/invoices/orders/1/document
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
